{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farmer\u2019s Market, a cozy low-poly farming simulator where country life comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, nurture, and harvest your own crops, then take your fresh produce to the market to sell, earn coins, and unlock new seeds, tools, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your farm at your own pace: expand your land, decorate your surroundings, and experiment with different crop combinations to maximize your profits. With its colorful low-poly style and relaxing atmosphere, it\u2019s perfect for fans of farming, simulation games, and the slow life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the most successful farmer in the region?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949430?t=1757678305","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949430/5a5bd2e36f79c84f13a21991918a63f6f850e188/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757678305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949430/fb0115a529212b49c2cb03098e44096c6f659fa8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757678305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949430/fb0115a529212b49c2cb03098e44096c6f659fa8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757678305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farmer\u2019s Market, a cozy low-poly farming simulator where country life comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, nurture, and harvest your own crops, then take your fresh produce to the market t